  "tabs": {
    "background": {
      "label": "专业背景",
      "lede": "紫外灯照在岩屑上，含油部分会发荧光。发什么颜色、有多亮，能大致判断油质和含油级别——这是井场上最快的一次含油性体检，也是主观性最强的一步。同一块样品两个人给两个级别，通常不是态度问题，而是光照不可比：模型如果直接学图像，学到的往往是「那天的灯有多亮」，而不是「这块岩屑含多少油」。",
      "judge": [
        { "label": "任务类型", "value": "图像分类 + 序回归", "desc": "级别分类与发光强度回归" },
        { "label": "数据门槛", "value": "单井 200—600 张", "desc": "需按含油级别分级标注" },
        { "label": "可见收益", "value": "分级一致性", "desc": "减少「同一块样品两个结论」" },
        { "label": "难度", "value": "中", "html": "<span class='dtag' data-d='中'>难度 中</span>", "desc": "成像条件难统一，跨井迁移差" }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "当前做法与问题",
          "html": "<p>荧光判读看两件事：<b>颜色</b>（判断油质）与<b>亮度</b>（判断含油级别）。颜色相对客观；亮度则强烈依赖灯源功率、照射距离、曝光时间，甚至岩屑表面湿度。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 226' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='荧光级别与油质对照矩阵'><rect width='620' height='226' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='185' y='18' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>荧光 1 级</text><text x='303' y='18' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>荧光 2 级</text><text x='421' y='18' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>荧光 3 级</text><text x='539' y='18' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>荧光 4 级</text><text x='12' y='48' font-size='9.4' fill='#242b2e' font-weight='600'>轻质油</text><text x='12' y='62' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>淡黄 / 月光白</text><rect x='130' y='30' width='110' height='46' rx='6' fill='#f4e6a8' fill-opacity='.35' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><circle cx='185' cy='53' r='7.2' fill='#ffffff' fill-opacity='.42'/><rect x='248' y='30' width='110' height='46' rx='6' fill='#f4e6a8' fill-opacity='.54' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><circle cx='303' cy='53' r='9.4' fill='#ffffff' fill-opacity='.54'/><rect x='366' y='30' width='110' height='46' rx='6' fill='#f4e6a8' fill-opacity='.73' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><circle cx='421' cy='53' r='11.6' fill='#ffffff' fill-opacity='.66'/><rect x='484' y='30' width='110' height='46' rx='6' fill='#f4e6a8' fill-opacity='.92' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><circle cx='539' cy='53' r='13.8' fill='#ffffff' fill-opacity='.78'/><text x='12' y='110' font-size='9.4' fill='#242b2e' font-weight='600'>中质油</text><text x='12' y='124' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>金黄</text><rect x='130' y='92' width='110' height='46' rx='6' fill='#e0b455' fill-opacity='.35' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><circle cx='185' cy='115' r='7.2' fill='#ffffff' fill-opacity='.42'/><rect x='248' y='92' width='110' height='46' rx='6' fill='#e0b455' fill-opacity='.54' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><circle cx='303' cy='115' r='9.4' fill='#ffffff' fill-opacity='.54'/><rect x='366' y='92' width='110' height='46' rx='6' fill='#e0b455' fill-opacity='.73' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><circle cx='421' cy='115' r='11.6' fill='#ffffff' fill-opacity='.66'/><rect x='484' y='92' width='110' height='46' rx='6' fill='#e0b455' fill-opacity='.92' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><circle cx='539' cy='115' r='13.8' fill='#ffffff' fill-opacity='.78'/><text x='12' y='172' font-size='9.4' fill='#242b2e' font-weight='600'>重质油</text><text x='12' y='186' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>棕褐</text><rect x='130' y='154' width='110' height='46' rx='6' fill='#a9713c' fill-opacity='.35' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><circle cx='185' cy='177' r='7.2' fill='#ffffff' fill-opacity='.42'/><rect x='248' y='154' width='110' height='46' rx='6' fill='#a9713c' fill-opacity='.54' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><circle cx='303' cy='177' r='9.4' fill='#ffffff' fill-opacity='.54'/><rect x='366' y='154' width='110' height='46' rx='6' fill='#a9713c' fill-opacity='.73' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><circle cx='421' cy='177' r='11.6' fill='#ffffff' fill-opacity='.66'/><rect x='484' y='154' width='110' height='46' rx='6' fill='#a9713c' fill-opacity='.92' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><circle cx='539' cy='177' r='13.8' fill='#ffffff' fill-opacity='.78'/><text x='310' y='218' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>横向 = 亮度（级别）· 纵向 = 颜色（油质）· 两个维度必须分开建模</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　同一油质下，级别越高越亮；同一级别下，油质越重颜色越深。<b>这是两个正交维度</b>，混在一起判，模型会把「亮」当成「重」——这类错误在混淆矩阵里看不出来，只会表现为「高级别总是被判偏」。</p><p>现场典型的问题是「同一块样品，两个人给两个级别」。这不是态度问题，是光照不一致导致的可比性问题。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 176' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='影响发光强度的因素排序'><rect width='620' height='176' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>CONFOUNDERS · 影响发光强度的因素</text><text x='142' y='40' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>灯源功率</text><rect x='150' y='31' width='312' height='12' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='470' y='40' font-size='8.2' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>强 · 82</text><text x='142' y='68' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>照射距离</text><rect x='150' y='59' width='281' height='12' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='439' y='68' font-size='8.2' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>强 · 74</text><text x='142' y='96' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>曝光时间</text><rect x='150' y='87' width='258' height='12' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='416' y='96' font-size='8.2' fill='#a97a1c' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>中 · 68</text><text x='142' y='124' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>岩屑湿度</text><rect x='150' y='115' width='171' height='12' rx='2.5' fill='#b26a39' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='329' y='124' font-size='8.2' fill='#b26a39' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>中 · 45</text><text x='142' y='152' font-size='8.8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='end' font-weight='600'>油质本身</text><rect x='150' y='143' width='342' height='12' rx='2.5' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.9'/><text x='500' y='152' font-size='8.2' fill='#2f7d6b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' font-weight='600'>信号 · 90</text><text x='0' y='170' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>前四项都是干扰，只有最后一项是信号</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　<b>不控制前四项，模型学到的就是灯有多亮</b>。更麻烦的是它在训练集上表现很好——因为它确实完美拟合了「那天的灯」，只是换一个班次就崩。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "AI 能做什么",
          "html": "<p>把任务拆成两个输出：<b>级别分类</b>（1—4 级）与<b>油质分类</b>（轻 / 中 / 重），并在成像端做标准化。三件事分开做，每件都能单独验收。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 122' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='荧光判读的五个环节'><rect width='620' height='122' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='8' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='8' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#9ba3a9'/><text x='18' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>01 · FIX</text><text x='18' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>成像标准化</text><text x='18' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>白平衡 / 曝光</text><text x='18' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>带参考色卡</text><path d='M121 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M129 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='131' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='131' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#41699b'/><text x='141' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#41699b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>02 · SEG</text><text x='141' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>区域提取</text><text x='141' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>分离岩屑</text><text x='141' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>排除泥浆荧光</text><path d='M244 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M252 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='254' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='254' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='264' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>03 · FEAT</text><text x='264' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>双分支特征</text><text x='264' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>亮度 → 级别</text><text x='264' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>色相 → 油质</text><path d='M367 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M375 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='377' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='377' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='387' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>04 · OUT</text><text x='387' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>两个独立头</text><text x='387' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>级别（序回归）</text><text x='387' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>油质（三分类）</text><path d='M490 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M498 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='500' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#767a2e' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='500' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#767a2e'/><text x='510' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#767a2e' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>05 · CHECK</text><text x='510' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>交叉验证</text><text x='510' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>与气测 / 地化</text><text x='510' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>找矛盾段</text><text x='310' y='114' font-size='8.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>第 1 步的价值最大也最容易被忽略：标准化做好，问题就解决了一半</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　第 2 步是现场最容易漏的：<b>油基泥浆本身就会发荧光</b>，整张图变亮。不先分割岩屑、只统计掩膜内的发光，模型学到的是「用了什么泥浆」。</p><p>第 4 步的关键是「两个头」：级别用序回归（1 &lt; 2 &lt; 3 &lt; 4 本身有顺序，当成四个平行类别会丢信息），油质用三分类。<b>把这两件事塞进一个 softmax，等于逼模型在「亮」和「重」之间做取舍</b>。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "你需要准备什么",
          "html": "<p style='margin-bottom:14px'>荧光图像不多，但「分级」有行业口径，标注反而比岩屑好做一点。真正的难点是分布：级别越高样本越少。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 128' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='含油级别分布'><rect width='620' height='128' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>LEVEL DISTRIBUTION · 级别分布（典型）</text><rect x='20' y='30' width='197.2' height='26' rx='3' fill='#9ba3a9' fill-opacity='.8'/><rect x='217.2' y='30' width='162.4' height='26' rx='3' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.8'/><rect x='379.6' y='30' width='139.2' height='26' rx='3' fill='#b26a39' fill-opacity='.8'/><rect x='518.8' y='30' width='81.2' height='26' rx='3' fill='#7e5a8d' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='118' y='47' font-size='9' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>荧光 1 级 · 34%</text><text x='298' y='47' font-size='9' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>2 级 · 28%</text><text x='449' y='47' font-size='9' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>3 级 · 24%</text><text x='559' y='47' font-size='8.2' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>4 级 14%</text><text x='20' y='78' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>级别越高样本越少——因为好显示本来就少。</text><text x='20' y='94' font-size='8.4' fill='#b05a51'>这是典型的「重要类别样本少」，且 1 级与 2 级的边界本身就模糊。</text><rect x='20' y='104' width='580' height='1' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='20' y='120' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>验收思路：先只看「有显示 / 无显示」，再上四级。四级标签的噪声会大得多</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　级别 4 只有 14%。<b>不做类别加权，模型会把高级别整体判低</b>——而高级别恰恰是决定要不要试油的那一档。</p><p style='margin-top:12px'><b>数据准备清单</b></p><p>· <b>荧光岩屑图像</b>：固定紫外灯源与曝光，单井 200—600 张，按含油级别分级<br>· <b>对应岩屑描述</b>：含油级别、油质，作为标签<br>· <b>成像参数</b>：灯源功率、照射距离、曝光时间，用于归一化<br>· <b>试油验证</b>：层段产液性质，少量真值</p><p><b>最容易漏的一条</b>　「成像参数」不是元数据，是<b>归一化的分母</b>。没有它，标准化就无从下手——只能眼睁睁看着不同班次的图无法比较。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "技术难度与参考方向",
          "html": "<div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px'><span class='dtag' data-d='中'>难度 中</span><span style='font-size:12px;color:#79828a'>图像任务不难，难在成像条件与跨井可比性。</span></div><svg viewBox='0 0 620 158' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='难度分解'><rect width='620' height='158' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHY HARD · 难度来自哪一项</text><text x='102' y='36' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>数据可得性</text><rect x='110' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#3f8560' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='158' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='36' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>每口井都有荧光</text><text x='102' y='61' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>成像一致性</text><rect x='110' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><text x='185' y='61' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>灯源 / 距离 / 曝光</text><text x='102' y='86' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>类别均衡</text><rect x='110' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='86' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>高级别样本少</text><text x='102' y='111' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>可解释性</text><rect x='110' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='158' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='111' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>需给颜色依据</text><rect x='110' y='128' width='300' height='1' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='110' y='146' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>唯一 3 格是「成像一致性」——这是工程问题，不是算法问题</text><text x='418' y='36' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>难度分级</text><rect x='418' y='44' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#3f8560' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='53' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>低</text><rect x='418' y='60' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='69' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>中</text><rect x='418' y='76' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='85' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>高</text><text x='418' y='118' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>落地顺序</text><text x='418' y='133' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>① 有/无显示（二分类）</text><text x='418' y='146' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>② 四级 + 油质</text><text x='418' y='159' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>③ 跨井迁移</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　唯一 3 格是「成像一致性」。<b>这是工程问题，不是算法问题</b>，但它决定算法上限——所以它应该排在第一笔预算里，而不是最后一笔。</p><p><b>推进顺序</b>　先做「有显示 / 无显示」二分类，跑通再上四级。级别边界本身有主观性，四级标签的噪声会大得多——<b>先证明「标准化之后人机一致率提升」，比多分一级更有说服力</b>。</p><p><b>可借鉴的通用技术</b>　图像分类 · 颜色特征工程 · 成像标准化 · 序回归</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 5,
          "en": "WHAT · WHY · HOW",
          "title": "AI 方法拆解：用了什么、为什么、怎么起作用",
          "html": "<p>如果你只想从这个案例里记一件事，记这个：<b>先修数据，再谈模型</b>。这里一个除法（除以灯源系数）就顶得上半年的调参——因为它去掉的是「系统性干扰」，而模型最擅长记住的恰恰就是系统性干扰。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 230' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='WHAT WHY HOW 三联'><rect width='620' height='230' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='6' y='6' width='198' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='18' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHAT · 用了什么</text><text x='18' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>标准化 + 双头输出</text><text x='18' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>三件东西，各有分工：</text><text x='18' y='72' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>① 除以灯源系数（规则）</text><text x='18' y='86' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>② 掩膜内统计（分割）</text><text x='18' y='100' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>③ 级别与油质分头输出</text><rect x='18' y='112' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.1' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='47' y='128' font-size='7.4' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>01</text><text x='47' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>归一</text><rect x='82' y='112' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#e6f1ec' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='111' y='128' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>02</text><text x='111' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>掩膜</text><rect x='146' y='112' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#f8ecdf' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='175' y='128' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>03</text><text x='175' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>双头</text><text x='18' y='176' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>① 里没有一个可训练参数，但它</text><text x='18' y='190' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>决定了后面两步有没有意义。</text><text x='18' y='204' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e'>顺序不能换：先归一，再分割，</text><text x='18' y='218' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e'>最后才是模型。</text><rect x='212' y='6' width='198' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='224' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHY · 为什么</text><text x='224' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>干扰比信号还强</text><text x='224' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>影响亮度的因素里，灯源、距离、</text><text x='224' y='72' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>曝光、湿度，前四项都比油质本身</text><text x='224' y='86' font-size='8.4' fill='#242b2e'>更容易被模型抓住。</text><text x='224' y='110' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>灯 1.6×</text><rect x='232' y='101' width='150' height='11' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='224' y='138' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>灯 1.0×</text><rect x='232' y='129' width='93' height='11' rx='2.5' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='224' y='166' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>灯 0.6×</text><rect x='232' y='157' width='56' height='11' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='224' y='188' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>同一块样品、同一级别，只因灯不同，</text><text x='224' y='202' font-size='8.4' fill='#242b2e'>读数就能差两级。模型无法分辨</text><text x='224' y='216' font-size='8.4' fill='#242b2e'>「更亮」和「更油」。</text><rect x='418' y='6' width='196' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='430' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>HOW · 怎么起作用</text><text x='430' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>先修数据，再谈模型</text><text x='430' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>同一次判读，两种做法：</text><rect x='430' y='68' width='172' height='34' rx='5' fill='#f9e9e5' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='440' y='82' font-size='8.2' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>不除以灯源系数</text><text x='440' y='95' font-size='7.8' fill='#79828a'>→ 判级随灯漂移</text><rect x='430' y='108' width='172' height='34' rx='5' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='440' y='122' font-size='8.2' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>除以灯源系数</text><text x='440' y='135' font-size='7.8' fill='#79828a'>→ 亮度只反映含油性</text><text x='430' y='160' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>但标准化只能修「增益」：</text><rect x='430' y='168' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#f9efd7' stroke='#a97a1c'/><text x='450' y='178' font-size='8.4' fill='#7d5a12'>灯太暗 → 信噪比不足，救不回</text><rect x='430' y='188' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#f9efd7' stroke='#a97a1c'/><text x='450' y='198' font-size='8.4' fill='#7d5a12'>没参考色卡 → 无从归一</text><text x='430' y='218' font-size='7.8' fill='#242b2e'>它的边界，比它的能力更值得记住。</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　左：用了什么。中：为什么非它不可。右：它凭什么有用，以及它能修什么、不能修什么。<b>最后那两行「救不回」比前三行更重要</b>——这决定你会不会把预算花错地方。</p>"
        }
      ]
    },

    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "案例：一个井组的荧光判读标准化",
      "lead": [
        "目标：把**级别判读的人机一致率**提到 0.85 以上，并把 1 级与 2 级的分界误差压到半个级别以内。",
        "难点不在「分级」，而在「1 级和 2 级之间那条线」——那条线本来就模糊，还会随灯漂移。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        ["图像", "1860 张"],
        ["井数", "5"],
        ["级别", "4"],
        ["目标一致率", "≥0.85"]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "成像标准化",
          "role": "工程环节",
          "do": "固定紫外灯源、照射距离、曝光与白平衡，每张图带参考色卡，并记录灯源系数。",
          "effect": "让亮度只反映含油性",
          "trap": "不同班次拍的图，模型会学成「班次差异」——**而且指标看不出来，因为训练集与验证集来自同一个班次**"
        },
        {
          "name": "区域提取",
          "role": "算法核心",
          "do": "把岩屑从背景与泥浆里分出来，只统计岩屑掩膜内的发光面积与平均亮度。",
          "effect": "避免背景荧光干扰",
          "trap": "油基泥浆本身会发荧光，整张图变亮——**这一步不做，模型学到的是「用了什么泥浆」**"
        },
        {
          "name": "级别分类",
          "role": "算法核心",
          "do": "把亮度与颜色解耦：亮度进级别分支（序回归），色相进油质分支（三分类）。",
          "effect": "两个维度分开建模",
          "trap": "一个头同时判，模型会把「亮」当成「重」——**混淆矩阵上看不出来，只会表现为高级别总判偏**"
        },
        {
          "name": "与气测和地化交叉验证",
          "role": "效果关键",
          "do": "把荧光级别与气测全烃、地化指标放在一起看，找出矛盾段并归因。",
          "effect": "用多证据压住主观性",
          "trap": "只看荧光，重质油会被系统性低估——**它荧光弱但含油可能很高，这是荧光判读的固有盲区**"
        },
        {
          "name": "复核与分歧回流",
          "role": "闭环",
          "do": "复核人给出级别与理由，1 级与 2 级之间的分歧样本单独归档并优先标注。",
          "effect": "把边界判断沉淀下来",
          "trap": "只回流级别不回流理由，模型学不到「为什么改」——**边界永远还是模糊的**"
        }
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "title": "五步要点：每一步产出什么、验收什么",
        "html": "<p>下面五张图对应上面五步。<b>第 1 步与第 5 步不含任何模型，但它们分别决定了「数据可不可比」和「边界能不能收敛」</b>。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第一步 成像标准化'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 01 · 成像标准化 · 参考色卡让「亮度」有了绝对参照</text><rect x='0' y='22' width='296' height='84' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='12' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>A · 现场随手拍</text><circle cx='60' cy='72' r='16' fill='#e0b455' fill-opacity='.32'/><circle cx='112' cy='76' r='13' fill='#e0b455' fill-opacity='.88'/><text x='140' y='64' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>同一级别</text><text x='140' y='78' font-size='8' fill='#b05a51'>两种亮度</text><text x='140' y='94' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>无法判断哪个是对的</text><rect x='312' y='22' width='308' height='84' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='324' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>B · 固定支架 + 色卡</text><circle cx='368' cy='72' r='16' fill='#e0b455' fill-opacity='.6'/><circle cx='420' cy='76' r='13' fill='#e0b455' fill-opacity='.6'/><rect x='466' y='50' width='14' height='14' rx='2' fill='#e0b455' fill-opacity='.6' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='.8'/><rect x='486' y='50' width='14' height='14' rx='2' fill='#f4e6a8' fill-opacity='.6' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='.8'/><text x='510' y='60' font-size='7.4' fill='#79828a'>色卡</text><text x='324' y='98' font-size='7.8' fill='#235f51'>同一级别，同一亮度（色卡可反推灯源系数）</text><text x='0' y='114' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>验收：同一块样品在不同灯源下，归一化后读数差 &lt; 0.3 级</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第二步 区域提取'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 02 · 区域提取 · 油基泥浆整张图都在发光</text><rect x='0' y='22' width='296' height='84' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='12' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>A · 未分割</text><rect x='12' y='44' width='272' height='50' rx='4' fill='#e0b455' fill-opacity='.42'/><circle cx='70' cy='69' r='12' fill='#e0b455' fill-opacity='.7'/><circle cx='130' cy='72' r='9' fill='#e0b455' fill-opacity='.7'/><circle cx='210' cy='68' r='14' fill='#e0b455' fill-opacity='.7'/><text x='12' y='108' font-size='7.8' fill='#b05a51'>背景（泥浆）贡献了大半亮度</text><rect x='312' y='22' width='308' height='84' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='324' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>B · 掩膜内统计</text><rect x='324' y='44' width='272' height='50' rx='4' fill='#f5f2ea'/><circle cx='394' cy='69' r='12' fill='#e0b455' fill-opacity='.7'/><circle cx='446' cy='72' r='9' fill='#e0b455' fill-opacity='.7'/><circle cx='526' cy='68' r='14' fill='#e0b455' fill-opacity='.7'/><circle cx='394' cy='69' r='15' fill='none' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-dasharray='3 2'/><circle cx='446' cy='72' r='12' fill='none' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-dasharray='3 2'/><circle cx='526' cy='68' r='17' fill='none' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-dasharray='3 2'/><text x='324' y='108' font-size='7.8' fill='#235f51'>只统计岩屑表面：发光面积比 + 平均亮度</text><text x='0' y='114' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>验收：切换泥浆体系后，同一级别的读数不出现系统性跳变</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第三步 双头输出与级别召回'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 03 · 双头输出 · 极值好分，中间难分</text><text x='100' y='38' font-size='8.6' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>荧光 4 级</text><rect x='108' y='29' width='286' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#7e5a8d' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='402' y='38' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>0.88</text><text x='100' y='62' font-size='8.6' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>荧光 3 级</text><rect x='108' y='53' width='263' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b26a39' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='379' y='62' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>0.81</text><text x='100' y='86' font-size='8.6' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>荧光 2 级</text><rect x='108' y='77' width='208' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><text x='324' y='86' font-size='8.2' fill='#a97a1c' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' font-weight='600'>0.64</text><text x='100' y='110' font-size='8.6' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>荧光 1 级</text><rect x='108' y='101' width='185' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#9ba3a9' fill-opacity='.9'/><text x='301' y='110' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' font-weight='600'>0.57</text><rect x='440' y='24' width='180' height='80' rx='7' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='452' y='42' font-size='7.6' fill='#242b2e'>两端好分，中间糊</text><text x='452' y='60' font-size='7.8' fill='#79828a'>1 级与 2 级共享同一条</text><text x='452' y='74' font-size='7.8' fill='#79828a'>模糊边界</text><text x='452' y='94' font-size='7.8' fill='#b05a51'>验收：相邻级混淆率 &lt; 25%</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第四步 交叉验证找矛盾段'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 04 · 交叉验证 · 重质油是荧光的固有盲区</text><rect x='60' y='22' width='240' height='82' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='60' y='22' width='120' height='41' fill='#f9e9e5' fill-opacity='.6'/><text x='120' y='38' font-size='7.2' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>荧光低 · 气测高</text><text x='120' y='50' font-size='7' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>重质油盲区</text><circle cx='96' cy='56' r='2.6' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.7'/><circle cx='140' cy='52' r='2.6' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.7'/><circle cx='112' cy='44' r='2.6' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.7'/><circle cx='186' cy='78' r='2.6' fill='#4d565b' fill-opacity='.5'/><circle cx='232' cy='62' r='2.6' fill='#4d565b' fill-opacity='.5'/><circle cx='252' cy='88' r='2.6' fill='#4d565b' fill-opacity='.5'/><circle cx='210' cy='40' r='2.6' fill='#4d565b' fill-opacity='.5'/><circle cx='268' cy='48' r='2.6' fill='#4d565b' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='180' y='114' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>气测全烃 →</text><text x='52' y='30' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>荧光</text><rect x='332' y='22' width='288' height='82' rx='7' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='344' y='40' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>矛盾段怎么用</text><text x='344' y='58' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>不是「模型错了」，是「这一档本来</text><text x='344' y='72' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>就看不出来」</text><text x='344' y='92' font-size='8.2' fill='#242b2e'>验收：矛盾段全部有归因，且能复现</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第五步 边界样本回流'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 05 · 分歧回流 · 1 级与 2 级之间的样本最贵</text><rect x='0' y='30' width='560' height='16' rx='3' fill='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='0' y='30' width='140' height='16' rx='3' fill='#9ba3a9' fill-opacity='.85'/><rect x='140' y='30' width='140' height='16' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.7'/><rect x='280' y='30' width='140' height='16' fill='#b26a39' fill-opacity='.7'/><rect x='420' y='30' width='140' height='16' rx='3' fill='#7e5a8d' fill-opacity='.7'/><text x='70' y='42' font-size='8' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>1 级</text><text x='210' y='42' font-size='8' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>2 级</text><text x='350' y='42' font-size='8' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>3 级</text><text x='490' y='42' font-size='8' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>4 级</text><rect x='120' y='24' width='60' height='28' rx='4' fill='none' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='150' y='70' font-size='7.8' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>模糊边界</text><path d='M150 74 V84' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M150 88l-3.4-5h6.8z' fill='#b05a51'/><rect x='0' y='88' width='268' height='22' rx='4' fill='#f9e9e5' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='12' y='103' font-size='8' fill='#b05a51'>这一带的样本单独归档，优先标注并记录理由</text><rect x='300' y='88' width='320' height='22' rx='4' fill='#e6f1ec' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='312' y='103' font-size='8' fill='#235f51'>同样的标注预算，用在这里的收益是普通样本的数倍</text></svg><p style='margin-top:14px'><b>怎么算「判得稳」</b></p><table class='dtable'><thead><tr><th>指标</th><th>定义</th><th>本例取值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>人机一致率</td><td>模型与复核完全相同的比例</td><td>0.86</td></tr><tr><td>相邻级混淆率</td><td>被判成相邻级别的比例</td><td>0.21</td></tr><tr><td>油质分类准确率</td><td>轻 / 中 / 重三分类</td><td>0.78</td></tr><tr><td>重质油召回</td><td>重质油被正确识别的比例</td><td>0.62</td></tr></tbody></table><p style='margin-top:12px'>主指标是<b>人机一致率</b>与<b>相邻级混淆率</b>，不是整体准确率。另外<b>重质油召回必须单列</b>——它只有 0.62，但这是荧光判读的物理盲区，不是模型能补的。</p>"
      },
      "fails": [
        { "name": "把亮度当含油性", "why": "灯更强时所有样品都更亮，模型学到的是灯。解决方向：固定成像 + 参考色卡，按灯源系数归一化后再训练。" },
        { "name": "油基泥浆干扰", "why": "泥浆本身发荧光，整张图变亮。解决方向：先分割岩屑掩膜，只统计掩膜内的发光面积与亮度。" },
        { "name": "重质油被低估", "why": "重质油荧光弱，容易判成低级别。解决方向：油质作为独立输出头，并把气测与地化作为交叉证据。" }
      ]
    },

    "demo": {
      "mode": "auto",
      "html": "demo/index.html",
      "label": "可运行示范",
      "intro": "拖「灯源功率」，看左边未标准化视野的判级怎么跟着漂，而右边除以灯源系数之后回到真实级别；再拖「真实含油级别」看高级别为什么不容易暴露问题；关掉「参考色卡」——两幅图会变成一模一样，因为标准化失去了分母。",
      "height": 680
    }
  }
}
